Input: {"question": "Which entity is Patersdorf a part of?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 107, "text": "**HEADLINE:** Small German Town of Patersdorf Stuns Locals with Surprise Inclusion in US Air Combat Command"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 109, "end": 372, "text": "**Patersdorf, Germany** - In a shocking move that has left residents and local officials alike scratching their heads, the small municipality of Patersdorf in southern Germany has been revealed to be part of the United States Air Force's Air Combat Command (ACC)."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 373, "end": 559, "text": "The news broke early yesterday morning when a team of US military officials arrived in Patersdorf, bearing documents and briefcases, to formally announce the town's inclusion in the ACC."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 560, "end": 702, "text": "The move is seen as a significant expansion of the US military's presence in Europe, and has sparked both excitement and concern among locals."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 703, "end": 838, "text": "\"We're still trying to wrap our heads around it,\" said Patersdorf Mayor, Herrmann Müller, in an exclusive interview with our newspaper."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 839, "end": 877, "text": "\"We had no idea this was in the works."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 878, "end": 1002, "text": "But we're proud to be part of this prestigious organization and look forward to working closely with our American partners.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1003, "end": 1143, "text": "According to sources within the US Air Force, Patersdorf's unique geography and infrastructure make it an ideal location for ACC operations."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1144, "end": 1302, "text": "The town's proximity to major European cities, combined with its relatively low population density, make it an attractive site for covert military operations."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1303, "end": 1435, "text": "\"We've been eyeing Patersdorf for some time now,\" said General James \"Hawk\" Wilson, Commander of Air Combat Command, in a statement."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1436, "end": 1586, "text": "\"Its strategic location and willingness to cooperate with our forces make it an invaluable asset in our mission to protect American interests abroad.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1587, "end": 1780, "text": "Data released by the ACC reveals that Patersdorf will serve as a key hub for reconnaissance and surveillance operations, with a focus on monitoring potential security threats in Eastern Europe."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1781, "end": 1956, "text": "The town's inclusion in the ACC is expected to bring significant economic benefits, with an estimated €10 million in annual investments and the creation of dozens of new jobs."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1957, "end": 2019, "text": "Not everyone in Patersdorf is thrilled with the news, however."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2020, "end": 2166, "text": "Local resident and peace activist, Anna-Lena Klein, expressed concerns about the potential environmental and social impacts of the ACC's presence."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2167, "end": 2286, "text": "\"We're worried about the noise pollution, the increased traffic, and the potential risks to our community,\" Klein said."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2287, "end": 2366, "text": "\"We want to make sure that our town remains a safe and peaceful place to live.\""}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2367, "end": 2485, "text": "As the news continues to sink in, residents of Patersdorf are coming to terms with their new role on the global stage."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 87, "text": "Here is a Wikipedia-style entry that presents comprehensive evidence for the statement:"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 89, "end": 103, "text": "**Patersdorf**"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 105, "end": 167, "text": "Patersdorf is a municipality in the state of Bavaria, Germany."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 168, "end": 190, "text": "**Electoral District**"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 192, "end": 287, "text": "Patersdorf is part of the lower-level electoral district of Stimmkreis Regen, Freyung-Grafenau."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 288, "end": 300, "text": "**Evidence**"}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 302, "end": 501, "text": "According to the official website of the Bavarian State Ministry of the Interior, for Sport and Integration, Patersdorf is located within the electoral district of Stimmkreis Regen, Freyung-Grafenau."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 502, "end": 705, "text": "[1] This is further supported by the website of the German Federal Returning Officer, which lists Patersdorf as one of the municipalities within the Stimmkreis Regen, Freyung-Grafenau electoral district."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 706, "end": 709, "text": "[2]"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 711, "end": 882, "text": "Additionally, the Bavarian State Election Office's official publication on electoral districts also confirms that Patersdorf is part of Stimmkreis Regen, Freyung-Grafenau."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 883, "end": 886, "text": "[3]"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc